        "expression": "let q = p * vec2<f32>(1.0, 0.8);\nlet r = length(q);\nlet a = atan2(q.y, q.x);\nlet n = cloud(q * 1.5 + vec2<f32>(t * 0.15));\nlet swirl = a + t * 0.4 + n * 1.8;\nlet core = exp(-r * 2.2);\n\nlet f = fract(swirl * 0.16 + t * 0.03);\nlet fireA = mix(vec3<f32>(0.7, 0.18, 0.04), vec3<f32>(0.9, 0.42, 0.1), smoothstep(0.0, 0.35, f));\nlet fireB = mix(fireA, vec3<f32>(0.95, 0.7, 0.25), smoothstep(0.35, 0.7, f));\nlet fireC = mix(fireB, vec3<f32>(0.95, 0.85, 0.65), smoothstep(0.7, 1.0, f));\nlet hot = mix(fireC, vec3<f32>(0.9, 0.85, 0.55), exp(-r * 3.5));\n\nlet bg = mix(c1, c3, smoothstep(0.2, 0.8, n));\nlet result = mix(bg, hot, core);\nlet flicker = 0.9 + 0.1 * noise(p * 5.0 + vec2<f32>(t * 2.5));\nreturn result * flicker;",
